    <para id="para-00045">Bruner, M. W., McLaren, C. D., Sutcliffe, J. T., Gardner, L. A., Lubans, D. R., Smith, J. J., &amp; Vella, S. A. (2023). The effect of sport–based interventions on positive youth development: A systematic review and meta–analysis. <emphasis effect="italics">International Review of Sport and Exercise Psychology</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">16</emphasis>(1), 368–395. https://doi.org/10.1080/1750984X.2021.1875496</para>
