    <glossary>
    <definition id="def-00001"><term>classroom climate</term><meaning>emotional culture of the learning environment</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00002"><term>positive youth development (PYD)</term><meaning>movement that aims to understand and promote predictors of well-being, thriving, and prosocial development in childhood and beyond</meaning></definition>
    </glossary>
